{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Roar of the Slayer|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Sion
|skill        = E
|icon         = Roar of the Slayer.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Sion}} bellows a shockwave in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} and shortly {{tip|slows}} the first enemy hit, {{sti|armor penetration|{{as|reducing their armor}}}} for a few seconds.
|blurb2      = If the target is a {{tip|minion}} or non-epic {{tip|monster}}, they are also briefly {{tip|stun|stunned}} and {{tip|airborne|knocked back}}, applying ''Roar of the Slayer's'' effects to enemies they pass through.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Sion''' bellows a shockwave in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit, {{tip|slow|slows}} them for {{fd|2.5}} seconds and inflicts them with {{sti|armor penetration|{{as|25% armor reduction}}}} for 4 seconds.
|description2 = If the target is a {{tip|minion}} or non-epic {{tip|monster}}, they are also {{tip|stun|stunned}} for {{fd|0.75}} seconds and {{tip|airborne|knocked back}} for up to 1350 units further, though not through terrain, applying ''Roar of the Slayer's'' effects to enemies they pass through as well as briefly granting {{tip|sight}} of the area around their trajectory.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|65 to 205}} {{as|(+ 55% AP)}}}}<!--
-->{{st|Slow|{{ap|40 to 60}}%}}
|range        = {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|800|Roar missile range}}|{{tt|1350|Maximum minion projectile range}}}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|160|Roar missile}}
|effect radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|130|Dashing minion collision radius}}
|speed        = 1800
|cooldown     = {{ap|12 to 8}}
|cost         = {{ap|35 to 55}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = Area of effect
|projectile   = Special
|notes        = 
* Minions or monsters that are flung away are immune to minion damage and take their damage once they are stopped if they would die to ''Roar of the Slayer's'' damage, by either colliding with terrain, reaching the end of their trajectory, or having their displacement interrupted.
* Unlike the intial single-target [[projectile]], a thrown minion or monster is not blocked by {{ai|Wind Wall|Yasuo}} or similar effects.
* Gaining or losing {{as|AP}}, or upgrading the ability while its projectile is traveling will change its damage for every future hit. This applies to both the intial single-target projectile, as well as the minion-projectile.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Boomerang Blade|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Sivir
|skill        = Q
|icon         = Boomerang Blade.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Sivir}} hurls her crossblade in the target direction that deals {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit.
|blurb2        = At max range, it homes back to '''Sivir''' to deal {{as|physical damage}} to enemies hit.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Sivir''' hurls her crossblade in the target direction, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies within its path, increased by {{critical damage|0 to 40|critScaling=true}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Physical Damage|{{ap|60 to 160}} {{as|(+ 70% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}}}}
|description2 = ''Boomerang Blade's'' damage is reduced by {{pp|key=%|changedisplay=true|type=non-champions hit|0 to 60 for 5|0 to 4|formula=100%-(15%*Nº of non-champions hit). ''This is capped at 40% damage at 4 enemies hit.''}}. Upon reaching maximum range, the crossblade returns to her, resetting the damage modifier and dealing the same damage to enemies on its way back.
|leveling2    = {{st|Minimum Damage|{{ap|60*0.4 to 160*0.4}} {{as|(+ {{ap|70*0.4}}% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 24% AP)}}}}
{{st|Total Maximum Champion Damage|{{ap|60*2 to 160*2}} {{as|(+ {{ap|70*2}}% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 120% AP)}}}}
|description3 = ''Enemies can be hit only once per pass.''
|cooldown     = {{ap|10 to 8}}
|cost         = {{ap|55 to 75}}
|costtype     = Mana
|target range = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 1250
|width        = {{dv|{{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|180|Outgoing missile}}|{{tt|200|Returning missile}}}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|1450|Outgoing missile}}|{{tt|1200|Returning missile}}}}
|cast time    = {{as|{{pp|type='''bonus''' attack speed|round=3|0.25;0.231;0.198;0.165;0.132;0.1|key1=%|0;15.2;41.6;68;94.4;120|formula=0.25*(1-(0.5 per 100% '''bonus''' attack speed)). ''This is capped at 60% reduction at 120% '''bonus''' attack speed.''}}|attack speed}}
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Physical
|projectile   = True
|spelleffects = AoE
|spellshield  = Special
|notes        = 
* Due to the cast time effectively rounding up to full game ticks, at undisturbed game tick interval times the technical minimum cast time is {{rutngt|0.1875}} reached at {{as|{{fd|99.8}}% '''bonus''' attack speed}}.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
* The damage reduction per unit hit resets back to full damage upon changing direction.
* ''Boomerang Blade'' will still return to '''Sivir''' even if she dies before it changes direction.
* {{tip|Spell shield}} only blocks one instance of damage.
|flavorsound  = {{sm2|Sivir_Original_Q_2.ogg}} ''"Take this!"''
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Ricochet|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Sivir
|skill        = W
|icon         = Ricochet.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Sivir}} gains {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}} for a few seconds. During this time, her basic attacks create projectiles that repeatedly bounce to nearby surrounding enemies, dealing {{as|physical damage}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Sivir''' empowers her crossblade for the next 4 seconds, gaining {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}} and causing her basic attacks to bounce to additional surrounding enemies, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to them. If the triggering attack {{tip|critical strike|critically strikes}}, the bounces will do so as well for {{as|{{critical damage|{{ccd|Sivir|crit_base}}|100}}|critical damage}} damage. ''Ricochet'' deals 65% damage against {{tip|minions}} and executes them if they would be left below {{sti|{{as|15 health}}}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Bonus Attack Speed|{{ap|20 to 40}}%}}
{{st|Bounce Damage|{{as|{{ap|40 to 50}}% AD}}|Bounce Critical Damage|{{as|{{ap|40*{{ccd|Sivir|crit_base}}/100 to 50*{{ccd|Sivir|crit_base}}/100}}% AD}}}}
{{st|Minion Bounce Damage|{{as|{{ap|40*0.65 to 50*0.65}}% AD}}|Minion Bounce Critical Damage|{{as|{{ap|(40*0.65)*{{ccd|Sivir|crit_base}}/100 to (50*0.65)*{{ccd|Sivir|crit_base}}/100}}% AD}}}}
|description2 = Bounces occur only up to 8 times and can target each enemy up to one additional time per empowered attack. They prioritize the nearest new target, then the nearest target if no new targets are available.
|description3 = ''Ricochet {{tip|basic attack reset|resets}} '''Sivir's''' basic attack timer if it was {{tt|not already active|See notes}}. The target does not have to be {{tip|sight|visible}} to be bounced to.''
|cooldown     = 12
|cdstart      = on-cast
|cost         = 60
|costtype     = Mana
|effect radius= {{tt|500|Bounce range}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|{{ccd|Sivir|missile_speed}}|Attack missile speed, same as basic attack}}| {{tt|1000|Bounced missile speed}}}}
|cast time    = none
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Auto
|affects      = Self
|damagetype   = Physical
|spelleffects = proc
|onhiteffects = Special
|spellshield  = False
|parry        = unknown
|projectile   = True
|notes        = 
* ''Ricochet''-enhanced basic attacks can bounce from structures onto secondary targets but not from nearby units onto structures.
* {{Pending for test}}: ''Ricochet's '' interactions with {{tip|dodge|dodging}}, {{tip|block|blocking}}, and {{tip|blind|blinding}} effects.
* ''Ricochet'' do not apply to additional targets with {{ii|Runaan's Hurricane}}.
* '''Sivir's''' attack timer will only reset from casting ''Ricochet'' if the ability's buff was not already active on her. Refreshing the buff will not grant an attack reset.{{bug}}
}}

{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Twilight Assault|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Shen
|skill        = Q
|icon         = Twilight Assault.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Shen}} recalls his {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} to his location, which shortly {{tip|slow|slows}} enemies hit while moving away from him.
|blurb2       = Once it arrives, '''Shen''' empowers his next three basic attacks within a period to gain {{sti|range|'''bonus''' range}} and deal {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}} based on the {{as|target's '''maximum''' health}}.
|blurb3       = If the {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} hits at least one enemy {{tip|champion}} during the travel, the empowerment is enhanced and additionally grants him {{sti|as|{{as|'''bonus''' attack speed}}}}.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Shen''' recalls his {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} to him. Enemy champions hit by the {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} along its path are {{tip|slow|slowed}} for the next 2 seconds while moving away from '''Shen'''.
|leveling     = {{st|Slow|{{ap|25 to 45}}%}}
|icon2        = Twilight Assault 2.png
|description2 = Once it arrives, '''Shen''' empowers his next 3 {{tip|basic attacks}} within 8 seconds to gain {{sti|range|75 '''bonus''' range}} and deal {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}} {{tip|on-hit}}. Against {{tip|structures}}, only the flat damage portion is applied.
|leveling2    = {{st|Bonus Magic Damage|{{pp|10 to 40 for 6|1 to 16}} {{as|(+ {{ap|2 to 4}}% {{as|(+ {{fd|1.5}}% per 100 AP)}} of target's '''maximum''' health)|health}}|Total Magic Damage|{{pp|10*3 to 40*3 for 6|1 to 16}} {{as|(+ {{ap|2*3 to 4*3}}% {{as|(+ {{fd|4.5}}% per 100 AP)}} of target's '''maximum''' health)|health}}}}
|icon3        = Twilight Assault 3.png
|description3 = If the {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} hits at least one enemy {{tip|champion}} during the travel, the attacks are further enhanced to deal {{ccs|{{as|'''increased bonus''' magic damage}}|magic}} and additionally grant '''Shen''' {{sti|as|{{as|50% '''bonus''' attack speed}}}}.
|leveling3    = {{st|Increased Bonus Damage|{{pp|10 to 40 for 6|1 to 16}} {{as|(+ {{ap|5 to 7}}% {{as|(+ 2% per 100 AP)}} of target's '''maximum''' health)|health}}|Total Increased Damage|{{pp|10*3 to 40*3 for 6|1 to 16}} {{as|(+ {{ap|5*3 to 7*3}}% {{as|(+ 6% per 100 AP)}} of target's '''maximum''' health)|health}}}}
|description4 = Empowered attacks against {{tip|monsters}} deal 100% '''bonus''' damage, but their '''total''' damage is capped.
|leveling4    = {{st|Maximum Monster Damage|{{ap|100 to 200}}}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|8 to 5}}
|cdstart      = on-cast
|cast time    = none
|cost         = {{ap|140 to 100}}
|costtype     = energy
|effect radius= {{tt|Global|Spirit Blade recall range}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|160|Spirit Blade missile width}}
|speed        = {{tt|2000 - 5000|Spirit Blade missile speed, 2000 U/s acceleration}}
|targeting        = Auto
|affects          = Enemies
|damagetype       = Magic
|spelleffects     = Proc
|spellshield      = True
|parry            = true
|projectile       = Special
|grounded         = 
|knockdown        = 
|notes            = 
* The {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} will track '''Shen''' as it is traveling to him, following his movements if he changes locations while the blade is in-flight.
* The {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} will stop in place upon colliding with {{tip|projectile|projectile-intercepting}} effects. If this occurs, '''Shen''' will not gain the empowered attacks as the {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} failed to complete its travel to him.
* When it is recalled, the {{as|Spirit Blade|buzzword}} also checks for units whose {{tip|gameplay radius}} it overlaps with (equal to a {{tip|er|icononly = true}} 0 radius check) before flying off, allowing it to hit enemies whose center is behind the missile origin.
* The empowered attack will not trigger against {{tip|wards}}.
}}
